    <statement><p>Evaluate the definite integral</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle \int_{ 3 } ^ { 9 } (18x^{2}-4x+7) dx =</m> <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{18}{3}\cdot 9^{3}-\frac{4}{2}\cdot 9^{2}+7\cdot 9-\left(\frac{18}{3}\cdot 3^{3}-\frac{4}{2}\cdot 3^{2}+7\cdot 3\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
